     "en": [
      "2. stop trying to multitask"
     ],
     "texte": "1. [[Le Vieil Homme et la Mer]]"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "every task switch forces",
      "your working memory to",
      "drop one context and",
      "load another"
     ],
     "texte": "un vieux pêcheur, 84 jours sans rien prendre, puis [[un poisson géant]] qui lâche rien"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "doing 2 things at once",
      "feels productive, but",
      "your brain is just",
      "constantly re-orienting"
     ],
     "texte": "c'est juste un long combat en pleine mer, et tu [[le soutiens]] jusqu'à la dernière page"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "one task, one tab, until it's finished"
     ],
     "texte": "Hemingway, 120 pages, [[un dimanche aprèm]]"
    }
